      "side": 1,
      "message": "Duplicating the calls to `cleanupTCPAddr` seems a little fragile for future refactoring.\n\nAs an alternative, consider naming the return values and using a `defer`:\n```go\nfunc (c *Client) ListenTCP(laddr *net.TCPAddr) (l net.Listener, err error) {\n\t…\n\tif laddr.Port \u003e 0 {\n\t\tch \u003d c.forwards.add(laddr)\n\t\tdefer func() {\n\t\t\tif err !\u003d nil {\n\t\t\t\tc.forwards.remove(laddr)\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}()\n\t}\n```",
